# KI-011: An iodine sink changes induction time without requiring a faster source reaction
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2SO4 0.001mol
add v1 KI 0.002mol
add v1 H2O2 0.002mol
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.0001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 H2SO4 0.001mol
add v2 KI 0.002mol
add v2 H2O2 0.002mol
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.0002mol
wait 10s
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
wait 30s
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
wait 60s
inspect
